    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 18 Church Park Court to the market. An attractive 2 bedroom, end of terrace bedroom home positioned at the end of a quiet cul de sac within this much sought after development located beside Harolds Cross village with a wide selection of amenities on your doorstep and walking distance to the city centre. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is laid out over two floors and briefly comprises of an entrance porch leading to a bright & spacious open plan living/dining downstairs with open marble fireplace, laminate flooring and storage underneath the stairs.  The kitchen is located off the dining area, the kitchen has a range of kitchen units, tiled splashback and sink unit. \r\n\r\nUpstairs the landing leads to two double bedrooms, a fully tiled spacious bathroom, hot press with shelving and a floored attic space completes the accommodation. \r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, situated within walking distance to the villages of Harold's Cross, Rathmines and Portobello. Amenities are in abundance in the area including schools, shops, restaurants and a host of recreational facilities to name a few. Transport links are ideal with a number of bus routes in the area linking to the city centre and further afield. The property is convenient to the M50."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nOpen plan Living/Dining \r\nLiving/Dining area \r\nCeiling coving, laminate flooring, open fire with marble fireplace, understairs storage. Window to side and front. \r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nRange of overhead and undercounter kitchen units, tiled splashback, 1 1/3 sink unit, oven, hob and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\r\nHotpress with shelving and access to attic\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Front)\r\nFitted wardrobes, laminate flooring, juliette balcony\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Front) \r\nFitted wardrobes, laminate wood flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nBath with shower attachment, w.c, whb and fully tiled floor and walls. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nTo the front is an area for parking. Positioned at the end of a quiet cul de sac."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "GFCH\r\nDouble glazed \r\nCul de sac \r\nQuiet location\r\nBeside a selection of primary and secondary schools \r\nWalking distance to local shops and supermarkets\r\nBeside Harold’s Cross village & park\r\nGreat transport links on Harold’s Cross Road \r\nConvenient to M50 and city centre"
      },
